1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,100
Good sleep is one of the best
things you can do for your health.

2
00:00:04,084 --> 00:00:06,584
Keep your bedroom
dark, cool and quiet.

3
00:00:07,564 --> 00:00:10,852
Put your phone away an hour before
bed and read a book instead.

4
00:00:11,836 --> 00:00:14,873
Try to go to bed and wake up
at the same time every day.

5
00:00:15,868 --> 00:00:19,155
Avoid coffee in the afternoon
and heavy meals late at night.

6
00:00:20,116 --> 00:00:23,441
A short walk in the morning
sunlight helps your body clock too.

7
00:00:24,436 --> 00:00:28,023
After a week of good habits you will
wake up feeling fresh and ready for the

8
00:00:28,036 --> 00:00:28,636
day.
